HYP-3118 coordinate-resurrection sheaf scout -- codex S267
This is evidence and route selection, not a proof.

====================================================================================================
REPAIR HYPERGRAPH: SIDECARS AS COORDINATE-RESURRECTION EDGES
====================================================================================================
- labelled_packet_decision_tree [HYP-3117/HYP-2963]
  coords=endpoint_owner,finite_address,packet_label,route_purity
  note=old labelled packets resurrect finite address and endpoint owner together
- observer_gluing_certificate [HYP-3098/HYP-3107]
  coords=chart_overlap,observer_gluing,terminal_exit
  note=observer chart compatibility and terminal discharge interface
- ear_decomposition_gluing_grammar [ear-decomposition theorems/HYP-3108]
  coords=ear_decomposition,ear_parity,nested_ear_order,observer_gluing,strong_connectivity_witness
  note=treats directed/odd/nested ears as named gluing grammars for proof-state charts
- proof_circuit_uniformity_bus [HYP-3116/HYP-3117]
  coords=missing_input_vector,proof_circuit_basis,uniformity
  note=turns low-depth shortcuts into uniform proof-state circuits
- savitch_midpoint_certificate_ladder [Savitch/HYP-3108/HYP-3117]
  coords=proof_circuit_basis,reachability_halving,savitch_midpoint,uniformity
  note=uses midpoint reachability recursion as a uniform certificate ladder, not a stored path
- lee_yang_ear_payload_gate [HYP-3112/HYP-3109]
  coords=ear_payload_A_vector,root_ear_payload,root_motion,root_zero_locus
  note=restores root motion and one-runner ear payload, not only root count
- pgf_root_curve_section [HYP-3108/HYP-3109/HYP-3112]
  coords=discriminant_wall,lee_yang_extremality,pgf_curve,root_argument_path,root_ear_payload,root_zero_locus
  note=promotes the whole PGF curve and zero trajectory over any single p0 scalar
- root_lattice_two_map_portfolio [HYP-3113]
  coords=ear_certificate,relation_lattice_shape,root_ear_payload,savitch_midpoint
  note=couples analytic root portfolio to certificate ladder
- bravais_relation_shape_atlas [Bravais/HYP-3115]
  coords=basis_reduction_word,bravais_shape,low_height_wall,relation_lattice_shape
  note=records lattice shape class and low-height relation walls before using volume pressure
- minkowski_relation_wall_gate [HYP-3115/HYP-3062]
  coords=bravais_shape,low_height_wall,relation_lattice_shape
  note=relation-rich rows need wall labels and shape, not raw covolume
- normal_fan_component_packet [HYP-3101/HYP-3096]
  coords=cech_barcode,component_bound,normal_fan_chamber
  note=component-bound proof route for normalized lonely-set packets
- first_obstruction_cocycle_gate [HYP-3102]
  coords=cocycle_exactness,dual_annihilator,obstruction_syndrome
  note=hidden payload difference is exact, generated, killed, descended, or debt
- state_lift_K33_gate [HYP-3094/THM-572]
  coords=K33_cross_handoff,active_binder,state_lift
  note=routes cross-handoff packets through named state-lift debt or construction
- pde_weak_form_operator [HYP-3111/S264b]
  coords=boundary_data,pde_weak_form,stiffness_matrix,zero_mode
  note=weak-form carrier preserves boundary/operator data before energy analogies
- phi4_quartic_density_stress_test [phi4_2/HYP-3111]
  coords=boundary_data,pde_weak_form,quartic_density_moment_curve,zero_mode
  note=quartic density is a stress test for moment/root analogies only with boundary data retained
- finite_interval_margin_packet [HYP-3114]
  coords=approximation_margin,endpoint_margin,finite_grid_hit
  note=resurrects rational-grid witness transfer only after an interval exists
- route_center_median_ledger [HYP-3069/HYP-3070]
  coords=median_center,route_center,sidecar_closure
  note=legal route centers require sidecar closure before median arguments

proof-route predicate used by scout:
  CORE = finite_address + observer_gluing + endpoint_owner + uniformity
  plus at least one LIVE sidecar:
  cocycle_exactness, component_bound, pde_weak_form, relation_lattice_shape, root_ear_payload, state_lift

