MAP B: external pattern -> LRC resurrection signal
- Savitch midpoint recursion
  external_pattern=reachability can be certified by recursively naming midpoints while reusing space
  lrc_reframe=proof reachability should store a recomputable midpoint certificate, not the whole route
  resurrects=uniformity,savitch_midpoint,proof_circuit_basis
  new_signal=midpoint_certificate_depth_profile
- Bravais lattice shape
  external_pattern=lattice behavior is controlled by shape class and basis choices, not only covolume
  lrc_reframe=Minkowski pressure needs relation-shape labels and low-height wall ownership
  resurrects=relation_lattice_shape,bravais_shape,low_height_wall
  new_signal=bravais_shape_wall_signature
- Lee-Yang extremality
  external_pattern=zeros move as a structured locus under parameter changes
  lrc_reframe=replace p0-only maximization by the PGF root curve, nearest-zero radius, and discriminant walls
  resurrects=root_ear_payload,root_zero_locus,pgf_curve,discriminant_wall
  new_signal=pgf_zero_trajectory_signature
- phi4 quartic density
  external_pattern=exp(-lambda*S^4-b*S^2) is controlled by moments, wells, and boundary regimes
  lrc_reframe=quartic energy analogies are legal only after boundary data and zero modes are sidecars
  resurrects=pde_weak_form,boundary_data,zero_mode,quartic_density_moment_curve
  new_signal=quartic_moment_wall_profile
- strong connectivity iff ear decomposition
  external_pattern=global directed connectivity can be certified by an ear-building grammar
  lrc_reframe=observer gluing should be tested by explicit ear certificates rather than asserted globally
  resurrects=observer_gluing,ear_decomposition,strong_connectivity_witness
  new_signal=observer_ear_certificate_type
- factor-critical iff odd ear decomposition
  external_pattern=matching-critical structure is exposed by parity-constrained ears
  lrc_reframe=payload ownership may require parity debt, not just a connected chart
  resurrects=endpoint_owner,ear_parity,parity_debt
  new_signal=odd_ear_payload_parity_debt
- series-parallel iff nested ear decomposition
  external_pattern=forbidden-minor simplicity appears as nested ear order
  lrc_reframe=proof routes may become tractable only after a nested-ear or branchwidth sidecar is declared
  resurrects=observer_gluing,nested_ear_order,series_parallel_shadow
  new_signal=nested_ear_branchwidth_shadow

